sequenceDiagram
    participant AG as agent daemon — refresh.mjs
    participant MK as agent/market.mjs
    participant DISC as Circle Agent Marketplace<br/>Discovery API
    participant LLM as x402 LLM sellers<br/>Agent Marketplace
    participant GW as Circle Gateway<br/>batched nanopayments
    participant CACHE as agent/.cache/reasoning.json

    AG->>MK: compose the market snapshot from The Graph
    AG->>DISC: discovery — query llm, filter network + supportsCircleGateway
    DISC-->>AG: services + accepts[] + price
    AG->>LLM: POST completions with the snapshot
    LLM-->>AG: 402 payment required
    AG->>GW: batched settlement from the agent wallet
    GW-->>LLM: settlement
    LLM-->>AG: verdict JSON — params · audit · rebalance
    AG->>CACHE: store with snapshotHash — 6h freshness, hash-bound
    Note over AG,GW: every paid call settles through Circle Gateway nanopayments only — raw EOA x402 paths are not used
    Note over AG,LLM: no Arc listings in the marketplace today — reasoning settles on Base/Polygon, Arc stays the execution chain
